abstract: >-
  Research software and committed evaluation artifacts for a preregistered feasibility study of
  multimodal RAG/VLM methods over Taiwan public-company filings. The registered candidate scored
  6/33 against a 17/33 baseline and received the frozen verdict NO_GO. This repository is not a
  production filing assistant and is not investment advice.
keywords:
